# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Indian Option MCP Server — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values you need.
# `.env` is git-ignored — your secrets never get committed.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Data provider to use: "nse" (default, free), "zerodha", "upstox", or "angel"
# DATA_PROVIDER=nse

# ── Zerodha Kite Connect (only needed if DATA_PROVIDER=zerodha) ──

# KITE_API_KEY=your_api_key
# KITE_API_SECRET=your_api_secret
# KITE_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_access_token   # refreshed daily via login flow

# ── Upstox v2 (recommended free broker; DATA_PROVIDER=upstox) ──
# 1. Create an app at https://developer.upstox.com → copy API Key + Secret.
# 2. Do the one-time OAuth login to mint an access token (see upstox.provider.ts).
#    The token is saved to `.upstox-token.json` (git-ignored) automatically,
#    OR you can paste it here. Tokens last ~24h — re-mint daily.

# UPSTOX_API_KEY=your_api_key
# UPSTOX_API_SECRET=your_api_secret
# UPSTOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_access_token   # optional if using .upstox-token.json

# ── Angel One SmartAPI (scaffolded; provider coming next) ──

# ANGEL_API_KEY=your_api_key
# ANGEL_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
# ANGEL_CLIENT_PIN=your_pin
